//   - `vectorSimilarityIndexCacheSize` (Number). Maximum size of the cache for vector similarity index. For details, see [ClickHouse documentation](https://clickhouse.com/docs/operations/server-configuration-parameters/settings#vector_similarity_index_cache_size).
